<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">
  <title>Información enviada · ENCLAII</title>
  <style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:20px;background:#06081c;color:#edf4ff;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}.card{width:min(460px,100%);padding:34px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(110,160,255,.2);border-radius:20px;background:#0e1740;box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}.icon{width:64px;height:64px;margin:0 auto 18px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(61,220,151,.12);color:#3ddc97;font-size:32px}h1{margin:0;font-size:23px}p{margin:11px 0 0;color:#91a5ce;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}.brand{margin-top:25px;letter-spacing:6px;font-weight:800}.brand span{color:#14b8f0}</style>
</head>
<body><main class="card"><div class="icon"></div><h1>Información enviada</h1><p>La clínica recibió tu pre-registro. El personal médico revisará tus datos antes de crear el expediente.</p><div class="brand">ENCLA<span>II</span></div></main></body>
</html>
